      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it feels like you're kind of dismissing those fears as just \"conspiracy theories\" while saying there's no evidence for them. if the policy actually does move toward more centralized control or surveillance-heavy tech in smart cities, wouldn't those critics be right to be worried? isn't it a bit biased to label the whole movement as baseless instead of looking at the potential for government overreach?",
